    "''Ali ibn Abi Talib stayed in Makkah three days until he had returned, on behalf of the Messenger of Allah ﷺ, the deposits people had left with him', then emigrated on foot and joined him in Qubaʾ. The Quraysh who wanted to kill him trusted him with their wealth.",
